From a903ec4823097b78a153b7c3847d9210c84b0654 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amatsuka <45129539+wsyzxjn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 03:53:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] usage, gui: a pooled subscription's all-accounts strip shows
 every pool window on the panel and routing group
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

On the tray panel's Allowances tab, renderPanelQuota passes max = 3 to
quotaAll, and a routing group's groupQuota sliced familyWindows(all.windows)
to 3 as well. For a pooled subscription such as Antigravity (whose
poolWindows lists Gemini · 5 hours, Gemini · 7 days, Claude & GPT · 5 hours,
Claude & GPT · 7 days, and Gemini 4 Argon · 7 days), slicing at 3 dropped
Claude & GPT · 7 days and Gemini 4 Argon · 7 days from the "All N accounts"
strip (.pq-all) and from a routing group's provider summary line, even
though each individual account card below it showed all five rings
(panelQuotaCard).

Now quotaAll and groupQuota apply the same pool-window bound as
panelQuotaCard (Math.max(4, max, ws.filter((w) => w.members).length)), so
every pool window is shown on the panel's strip and a routing group's line
while non-pooled subscriptions stay capped at 3. Pool windows in quotaAll
also include poolTip(w) in their tooltip.

Run, at this tree (on origin/main de7953e3):
- darwin arm64, node --test (Chromium and WebKit): quota-pool-model (4/4),
  quota-pools (4/4), quota-pool-order (4/4), usage-all-accounts (14/14: en,
  zh, zh-TW, ja, de; light and dark), usage-merge (7/7), i18n-keys (4/4),
  old-webkit (6/6): 43 of 43 ok. nav-timeout is red on window-visibility,
  already filed on main as #4787.
- go test -tags nogui -run TestCoreScriptBudget ./internal/gui: ok (app.js
  untouched).
- gofmt -l clean; GOOS=linux go vet -tags nogui ./..., GOOS=windows go vet
  -tags nogui ./... clean; GOOS=linux and GOOS=windows go build -tags nogui
  ok.

Broken by hand (red, then put back):
- quotaall.js back at ws.slice(0, max): quota-pool-model 4 of 4 red in
  Chromium and WebKit (en, zh), .pq-all missing 'Claude & GPT · 7 days' and
  'Gemini 4 Argon · 7 days'.

Not tried: the full 1000-file GUI suite; real Wails tray window on Windows
or Linux WebKitGTK (verified against a real 7-account Antigravity
quotas.json fixture in Chromium and WebKit on macOS).
